// Inkling 2 Mini routed MoE on the matrix units (`src/kernels/inkling2.rs`
// `moe_grouped_mu`): grouped by expert via `glm53_moe_group` with BF16 input
// (`glm53_to_bf16`), K stepped in 64-deep tiles (Inkling 2 Mini's ff = 1152
// is 18 * 64, not a multiple of 256).
//
// Two kernel families, each in 64-row and 128-row (`_r128`) tile variants
// across all 19 GGML weight types, with a register dot path (`inkling2_moe_dot.glsl`)
// for small single-tile experts (`rows <= dot_rows`):
// 1. `inkling2_gemm_moe_gu_situ_<type>[_r128]`: packed `[E, 2 * ff, H]` gate+up
//    with optional per-expert `gate_up_scale[e]` and fused SITU activation,
//    writing BF16 `mid[pair, ff]`.
// 2. `inkling2_gemm_moe_down_<type>[_r128]`: `[E, H, ff]` reading BF16 `mid`,
//    writing F32 `down_out[pair, H]` (reduced by `inkling2_moe_sum`).

